{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24076","headline":"闲居自题 · 白居易","name":"闲居自题","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"门前有流水，墙上多高树。\n竹迳绕荷池，萦回百余步。\n波闲戏鱼鼈，风静下鸥鹭。\n寂无城市喧，渺有江湖趣。\n吾庐在其上，偃卧朝复暮。\n洛下安一居，山中亦慵去。\n时逢过客爱，问是谁家住。\n此是白家翁，闭门终老处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24076.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24076","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}